# Expo SDK 57's default global `fetch` (the WinterCG-compliant "expo/fetch")
# does not support React Native's classic multipart file shape
# `{ uri, name, type }` passed to FormData.append — its RN-compat shim only
# recognizes `part.string`/`part.file`/`part.blob`, not `part.uri`, and throws
# "Unsupported FormDataPart implementation". Falling back to React Native's
# original fetch (which natively handles `{ uri, name, type }` parts) fixes
# uploadToBackend() without changing the upload code.
EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_RN_FETCH=1
